# This directory is bind-mounted into the firmware-download (nginx) container
# at /etc/nginx/certs.
#
# On first start, if no certificate is present here, the container generates a
# self-signed server.crt / server.key for FIRMWARE_SERVER_NAME (see
# ../nginx/10-gen-selfsigned.sh).  The generated files are gitignored.
#
# To use a certificate your network devices trust (required for IOS-XE
# `copy https:` to validate the server), drop your PEM files here as:
#     server.crt   (full chain: leaf + intermediates)
#     server.key   (private key, unencrypted)
# and restart the firmware-download service.
